{#- Hand-written recreation of DHUN's immersive Full Player (ADR-002) in its
    Lyrics tab: blurred-artwork backdrop, hero cover, transport row with the
    play disc, Lyrics | Queue | Related tabs.
    The lyric lines are the opening of "Twinkle, Twinkle, Little Star", an
    anonymous 19th-century text in the public domain, used as a clearly
    placeholder snippet. No real song, artist or artwork is depicted. -#}
<figure class="mock mock--phone" id="mock-player-phone">
  <div class="device" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="screen screen--player">
      <span class="blob blob-a"></span>
      <span class="blob blob-b"></span>
      <div class="statusbar">
        <span>9:41</span>
        <span class="statusbar-icons">{% icon "speaker" %}{% icon "offline" %}</span>
      </div>
      <div class="app app--player">
        <div class="player-head">
          <span class="chip">{% icon "gear" %}</span>
          <span class="player-context">Album · Track 1</span>
          <span class="chip">{% icon "list" %}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="cover art-hero"><span class="cover-glyph">{% icon "play" %}</span></div>
        <p class="player-title">Track title</p>
        <p class="player-artist">Artist name</p>
        <div class="scrub">
          <span class="scrub-bar"><span class="scrub-fill"></span></span>
          <span class="scrub-times"><span>1:12</span><span>3:48</span></span>
        </div>
        <div class="transport">
          <span class="t-icon">{% icon "shuffle" %}</span>
          <span class="t-icon">{% icon "skipPrev" %}</span>
          <span class="play-disc">{% icon "play" %}</span>
          <span class="t-icon">{% icon "skipNext" %}</span>
          <span class="t-icon">{% icon "repeat" %}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="tabs">
          <span class="tab is-active">Lyrics</span>
          <span class="tab">Queue</span>
          <span class="tab">Related</span>
        </div>
        <ul class="lyrics">
          <li>Twinkle, twinkle, little star,</li>
          <li class="is-current">How I wonder what you are.</li>
          <li>Up above the world so high,</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <strong>Illustrative recreation — not a screenshot.</strong>
    DHUN's immersive full player (ADR-002) on its Lyrics tab: the backdrop is the
    playing artwork blurred, the lyrics scroll line by line, and the transport
    row sits above a Lyrics | Queue | Related sheet. Lyric text shown here is a
    public-domain placeholder snippet, not a real song. A real Android capture
    replaces this during the S3 rounds.
  </figcaption>
</figure>
